   "ID": "card-steps",
   "Title": "Request path · data plane",
   "Color": "emerald",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "[1] orders publishes orders.order.placed. It does not know who listens",
    "The exchange copies it into every queue whose binding matches the key",
    "[2] The billing pods share their queue: each message goes to one of them",
    "[3] mailer gets its own copy in its own queue",
    "After 3 failed deliveries, billing's message goes to its own dead-letter queue"
